      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The initial meeting with David Gilles from Future Sustainability was awesome.I thought I knew what I was on about regarding solar systems and how everything works. He ran me through, based on my current average daily energy consumption, exactly how much I may be able to generate with a 2kw system from Future, and how much money this could generate selling to the grid during the day, and the total I would pay for my power worked out to be in credit on paper. Only got the system installed yesterday so I won't know real figures until another few months.I would highly recommend Future Sustainability to anybody considering a solar inverter grid connected system.",
