      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I appreciated your tips about choosing a system and the quotes gave me a good idea of what to expect. After considering these quotes and a few others that I got I did start to feel a little overwhelmed but finally I went with a gut feeling about the genuineness of the sales consultant that came to my home and the quality of the product as well as the price which was the best for the panels and inverter that I wanted. My final decision was made rather quickly in the end as I wanted to get in before the cut to the feed in tariff.",
