      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "With Future Sustainability the salesman wasn't pushy. None of this\" if you put our sign up for 6mths we'll cut $4000 off the price\" but \"you need to sign today\". Very informative on their products and up front about the whole process. They also had Australian backup on their products for warranty issues. Infinity solar was also good with their products and information, but they were outside our budget. Thank you Finn for your informative site it has helped me with all my research. Cheers",
